{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008520/extras/gif-turbine-half-fps.gif?t=1740778039\" /><br><br><strong>Perfect World</strong> is Quake-coded <strong><i>grindset simulator</i></strong>. Extract profits from the environment by traversing open-ended levels using abilities like a grappling hook and jetpack. Finally become your own boss, buy a deluxe condo, and achieve the good life, <strong><i>at any cost.</i></strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008520/extras/desc-mushroom-gameplay-50p.png?t=1740778039\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008520/extras/gif-mushroom.gif?t=1740778039\" /><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic mushroom-type gameplay.<br></li><li>Accurate capitalism simulation.<br></li><li>Money.<br></li><li>Advertising.<br></li><li>Environmental destruction.<br></li><li>Multiple platforming abilities including a grappling hook, jetpack, and <strong><i>SLAM</i></strong>.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008520/extras/desc-consume-destroy-50p.png?t=1740778039\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008520/extras/gif-shroomZone.gif?t=1740778039\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008520/extras/when-you-have-50p.png?t=1740778039\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008520/extras/logo-render-dissolve500px.png?t=1740778039\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008520?t=1740778039","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008520?t=1740